---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy — Subtitle Kit"
  description="Subtitle Kit processes files locally in your browser. Ads, if enabled, are served by third parties and do not receive your subtitle files."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>
    Subtitle Kit tools run entirely in your web browser using JavaScript. Subtitle and
    script content you paste is not transmitted to our servers because we do not operate
    backend processing for these tools.
  </p>
  <p>
    When you deploy this site, the hosting provider (e.g. Cloudflare Pages) may log
    standard HTTP requests (IP, user agent) for security and delivery.
  </p>
  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>
    Pages may load display ads from one or more of these networks when the site operator
    has configured publisher IDs: <a href="https://www.google.com/adsense/">Google AdSense</a>,
    <a href="https://monetag.com/">Monetag</a>,
    <a href="https://propellerads.com/">PropellerAds</a>, and
    <a href="https://adsterra.com/">Adsterra</a>. Those vendors may set cookies or collect
    device and IP data under their own policies:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google Privacy Policy</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://monetag.com/privacy-policy/">Monetag Privacy Policy</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://propellerads.com/privacy/">PropellerAds Privacy Policy</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://adsterra.com/privacy-policy/">Adsterra Privacy Policy</a></li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Ad scripts do not receive the subtitle files you open or paste. You can block ads with
    a browser content blocker; tools will keep working.
  </p>
  <p>Last updated: 2026-09-21</p>
</BaseLayout>
